WEBVTT

01:41.560 --> 01:45.920
ADAPTED FROM THE ORIGINAL WORK
"LOVER" BY SHE MU SI

01:50.400 --> 01:51.480
Hurry up and memorize it.

01:51.560 --> 01:53.160
I have other things to do later.

01:53.240 --> 01:55.600
"The bright moon through the branches
scares the magpies.

01:55.680 --> 01:57.840
Cicadas chirp in the midnight breeze.

01:57.920 --> 01:59.840
The scent of rice flowers
hints at a good harvest.

01:59.920 --> 02:01.920
Listen to the cacophony of frogs.

02:02.000 --> 02:03.440
Stars flicker in the night sky.

02:03.520 --> 02:05.160
A drizzle falls upon the mountain.

02:05.240 --> 02:07.320
The old straw shack still stands
beside the temple,

02:07.400 --> 02:09.479
appearing at the end of the bridge."

02:10.120 --> 02:11.720
Awesome, Niaoniao.

02:11.800 --> 02:12.960
You're improving rapidly.

02:13.040 --> 02:14.520
You can flatter me.

02:14.600 --> 02:17.360
But you still have to pay
for your massage.

02:17.440 --> 02:18.840
Sure, I'll definitely pay.

02:18.920 --> 02:20.680
Big news.

02:22.360 --> 02:23.600
Just now…

02:23.680 --> 02:24.880
Goodness!

02:24.960 --> 02:26.200
It was frightening.

02:26.760 --> 02:27.600
What's wrong?

02:27.680 --> 02:28.960
That Mrs. Chen.

02:29.440 --> 02:31.760
Chen Maidong from the funeral parlor.

02:31.840 --> 02:33.400
-His grandmother.
-What's wrong?

02:34.160 --> 02:36.200
Mom, hurry up and say it!

02:36.280 --> 02:37.480
Mrs. Chen

02:38.800 --> 02:41.080
carried a sickle
and broke into someone's yard.

02:41.160 --> 02:43.560
Then she started a fight
with the family by herself.

02:43.640 --> 02:44.640
Is she okay?

02:44.720 --> 02:46.160
She is an old lady.

02:46.240 --> 02:47.960
Who dares to hurt her?
Of course she's okay.

02:49.240 --> 02:50.160
Mom.

02:51.120 --> 02:53.280
Why? Which family?

02:53.360 --> 02:55.720
I heard Chen Maidong
got into a fight last night.

02:55.800 --> 02:57.280
The other guy

02:57.360 --> 02:58.800
was just released from prison.

02:58.880 --> 03:00.200
I think he is called Hedgehog.

03:00.280 --> 03:01.280
There was a big commotion.

03:01.360 --> 03:02.400
Even the police were there.

03:02.480 --> 03:04.560
Mrs. Chen supposedly
gave her grandson a beating first

03:04.640 --> 03:06.600
then took a sickle
and went to that brat's house.

03:06.680 --> 03:08.920
She said she wanted
to fight him to the death.

03:09.760 --> 03:10.920
Where are you going?

03:11.000 --> 03:12.760
It has ended. They went home long ago.

03:12.840 --> 03:13.880
Mom!

03:13.960 --> 03:15.720
Madam Wu persuaded her
to drop it and go home.

03:15.800 --> 03:17.080
Mom, continue to test me.

03:17.160 --> 03:18.120
The second section,

03:18.200 --> 03:19.040
"The Long March".

03:19.760 --> 03:22.240
-Jie is such a busybody.
-"The Red Army embraces difficulties."

03:22.320 --> 03:24.080
"Rivers and mountains are no tribulation."

03:33.440 --> 03:34.480
Mrs. Chen.

03:34.560 --> 03:35.880
You came, Jie.

03:35.960 --> 03:36.920
Mrs. Chen.

03:41.960 --> 03:43.520
You are spending money again.

03:43.600 --> 03:45.400
Eat more fruits.

03:45.480 --> 03:47.000
You are so well-informed.

03:47.080 --> 03:48.280
Thank you, Mrs. Chen.

03:52.040 --> 03:52.960
Mrs. Chen,

03:53.520 --> 03:54.400
are you okay?

03:54.480 --> 03:56.080
I'm fine.

03:57.040 --> 03:59.400
Do you think that little hedgehog
could prick me?

04:03.000 --> 04:03.960
It smells good.

04:05.160 --> 04:06.640
Are you making chicken soup?

04:06.720 --> 04:08.440
The free-range chickens your family sells

04:08.520 --> 04:09.880
have a really good meat texture.

04:09.960 --> 04:11.360
You don't have to buy it next time.

04:11.440 --> 04:12.520
I'll deliver them to you.

04:12.600 --> 04:13.520
No way.

04:13.600 --> 04:14.920
That's a different matter.

04:15.680 --> 04:16.880
Have a bowl later.

04:16.959 --> 04:18.079
I don't eat chicken.

04:18.160 --> 04:19.680
Our whole family doesn't eat chicken.

04:19.760 --> 04:21.360
I've been smelling it since I was young.

04:27.240 --> 04:28.280
About this fight,

04:28.360 --> 04:30.320
don't think of this old lady as a bully.

04:30.400 --> 04:31.880
I can't let bad people

04:31.960 --> 04:32.800
stay around Maidong.

04:33.800 --> 04:35.840
His accomplishments today

04:36.440 --> 04:37.640
did not come by easily.

04:37.720 --> 04:38.600
Jie,

04:39.200 --> 04:41.160
go up and tell that brat
to come down and eat.

04:41.240 --> 04:42.600
He hasn't eaten all day.

04:42.680 --> 04:43.680
Is he upstairs?

04:44.200 --> 04:45.200
Okay.

04:53.080 --> 04:54.120
I'm coming in.

04:59.080 --> 05:00.440
You knew you made a mistake, right?

05:00.520 --> 05:01.800
Is that why you are hiding here?

05:11.040 --> 05:12.240
I thought someone

05:12.320 --> 05:14.000
had gotten worse at fighting.

05:14.640 --> 05:16.560
It turns out
that he just doesn't fight at work.

05:20.360 --> 05:21.800
How old are you?

05:21.880 --> 05:23.240
I see you still get hurt in fights.

05:33.600 --> 05:34.600
You brat.

05:35.120 --> 05:36.320
Do you want to starve to death?

05:36.400 --> 05:37.560
Leave me alone.

05:37.640 --> 05:39.080
I didn't want to care about you.

05:39.160 --> 05:40.920
Your grandma asked me to call you to eat.

05:41.680 --> 05:42.640
What are you here for?

05:44.040 --> 05:45.480
To look at the laughingstock.

05:45.560 --> 05:46.680
It's a rare sight.

05:46.760 --> 05:47.640
I have a question.

05:47.720 --> 05:48.560
Ask away.

05:49.320 --> 05:50.200
Have you ever

05:51.000 --> 05:52.240
had feelings for me?

05:53.120 --> 05:54.280
Of course.

05:54.360 --> 05:57.040
So am I not as attractive as Shanghai

05:58.600 --> 06:00.440
or the guy at the barbecue restaurant?

06:06.200 --> 06:07.920
Did you really start a fight
because of this?

06:12.760 --> 06:13.760
It's so not worth it.

06:15.040 --> 06:16.440
Do you

06:17.920 --> 06:19.600
still have unrequited feelings for him?

06:19.680 --> 06:21.800
Did I look like
I still had feelings for him that day?

06:24.080 --> 06:25.400
So what are your plans now?

06:25.480 --> 06:26.800
What plans?

06:27.360 --> 06:28.520
You

06:28.600 --> 06:29.600
and me.

06:37.200 --> 06:38.600
No plans.

06:40.080 --> 06:41.960
Man proposes, God disposes.

06:42.920 --> 06:45.120
Nothing ever goes
according to my plan anyway.

06:46.200 --> 06:48.640
I would rather wish for more inspiration.

06:49.720 --> 06:51.480
Stop going off-topic.

06:51.560 --> 06:53.600
Have you not thought about it
or are you pretending?

06:54.920 --> 06:55.960
I didn't think about it.

07:09.880 --> 07:11.560
Then what is our relationship right now?

07:18.600 --> 07:19.600
I'm asking you.

07:21.280 --> 07:23.200
This is the first time you asked me this.

07:23.280 --> 07:24.680
You have to let me think about it.

07:24.760 --> 07:26.080
Still thinking?

07:27.920 --> 07:29.600
If you haven't figured it out,

07:29.680 --> 07:30.880
why are you flirting with me?

07:32.160 --> 07:33.760
Do you have too much free time?

07:36.800 --> 07:38.560
You did it too.

07:39.200 --> 07:41.960
Did I ask you for medicinal patches
or to go to the barbecue restaurant?

07:42.960 --> 07:44.600
It seems like I judged you incorrectly.

07:49.040 --> 07:49.880
Chen Maidong.

07:51.360 --> 07:52.200
Chen Maidong.

07:57.000 --> 07:58.080
Leave.

08:08.560 --> 08:09.520
Jerk.

08:10.160 --> 08:12.360
If I ever respond to you again,
I'm a fool.

09:20.000 --> 09:21.280
Do you still dare to fight?

09:21.360 --> 09:22.200
Yes.

09:22.280 --> 09:23.160
You.

09:23.240 --> 09:24.760
How dare you?

09:24.840 --> 09:26.080
Give me back the chicken soup.

09:26.720 --> 09:28.520
If you keep showing
someone like him tolerance,

09:28.600 --> 09:30.160
he will just become more daring.

09:30.240 --> 09:32.320
So is it your job
to teach him a lesson now?

09:32.400 --> 09:33.360
Show-off.

09:38.960 --> 09:40.920
What happened to the corner of your lips?

09:41.000 --> 09:42.080
It wasn't injured yesterday.

09:44.480 --> 09:46.640
Did Jie hit you?

09:57.720 --> 09:59.040
I told you!

09:59.120 --> 10:01.440
Sooner or later,
someone would whip you into line!

10:07.000 --> 10:07.880
Thank you.

10:10.000 --> 10:11.320
This is spirulina.

10:11.400 --> 10:12.880
It's good for your health.

10:24.960 --> 10:26.120
It tastes good.

10:29.360 --> 10:30.240
Ms. Lin.

10:30.320 --> 10:31.240
Look.

10:31.840 --> 10:33.360
We live in the same town.

10:33.440 --> 10:34.760
I've admired you for a long time.

10:34.840 --> 10:36.960
But as the director
of the local Women's Federation,

10:37.040 --> 10:38.520
I've failed to visit you.

10:38.600 --> 10:39.600
I've neglected my duty.

10:39.680 --> 10:41.240
Madam Wu, you're so busy.

10:41.320 --> 10:42.680
Why the sudden visit?

10:45.280 --> 10:47.160
Well, I just hope

10:47.240 --> 10:48.640
that you can give me some pointers.

10:48.720 --> 10:50.680
Madam Wu, you are too kind.

10:50.760 --> 10:52.000
What can I give you advice on?

10:52.080 --> 10:53.720
The rumors in the town

10:53.800 --> 10:55.000
are all without truth.

10:55.600 --> 10:56.800
How can that be possible?

10:56.880 --> 10:58.400
The year before last, the Xu family

10:58.480 --> 10:59.840
listened to your advice

10:59.920 --> 11:01.160
and stopped quarreling.

11:01.240 --> 11:03.520
Look, they're living their best lives now.

11:03.600 --> 11:05.520
There was also Feng's family.

11:05.600 --> 11:06.480
They listened to you

11:06.560 --> 11:07.920
and went to get some medicine.

11:08.000 --> 11:10.480
This year, they gave birth
to a big chubby boy.

11:10.560 --> 11:12.360
We were only chatting.

11:12.440 --> 11:14.240
Maybe it's because I'm old.

11:14.320 --> 11:15.800
I have experienced more things.

11:15.880 --> 11:18.480
I can see the other aspects
of a problem. That's all.

11:18.560 --> 11:21.560
Ms. Lin, just stop being modest, okay?

11:21.640 --> 11:24.080
If I wasn't about to go crazy,

11:24.160 --> 11:26.440
I wouldn't have come here to trouble you.

11:26.520 --> 11:27.960
You know my daughter, right?

11:28.040 --> 11:29.400
At the start of her relationship,

11:29.480 --> 11:30.960
they were passionately in love.

11:31.040 --> 11:32.840
But I don't know

11:32.920 --> 11:35.240
why she had to date her distant nephew.

11:35.320 --> 11:36.520
Being her mother,

11:36.600 --> 11:37.560
I've been so ashamed

11:37.640 --> 11:38.960
that I couldn't hold my head up.

11:39.040 --> 11:40.160
Get to the point.

11:40.240 --> 11:41.200
Yes, sure.

11:41.280 --> 11:43.000
The two of them

11:43.080 --> 11:44.520
finally overcame all the difficulties

11:44.600 --> 11:45.440
and got married.

11:45.520 --> 11:47.720
Life is pretty good for them too.

11:47.800 --> 11:49.520
They are so lovey-dovey

11:49.600 --> 11:50.880
but have nothing to show for it.

11:51.680 --> 11:52.560
Come on.

11:52.640 --> 11:54.920
Her daughter and son-in-law
are truly maddening.

11:55.000 --> 11:56.440
Whether people are watching or not,

11:56.520 --> 11:58.360
they hug and kiss whenever they want.

11:58.440 --> 12:00.720
They've been married
for three or four years, right?

12:00.800 --> 12:02.200
But they haven't got a child yet.

12:02.720 --> 12:04.240
How did you put it?

12:04.320 --> 12:05.800
"Determined but incapacitated."

12:07.160 --> 12:08.760
She has wanted to seek your advice

12:08.840 --> 12:11.320
to see if there are any ways to solve it.

12:11.800 --> 12:13.120
Maybe the two of them

12:13.200 --> 12:15.840
want a few more years to enjoy themselves.

12:15.920 --> 12:17.320
I understand this.

12:17.400 --> 12:19.800
Weren't we all like this
when we were young?

12:19.880 --> 12:20.760
Goodness.

12:20.840 --> 12:22.560
I wasn't like that when I was young.

12:22.640 --> 12:24.560
I was married in a proper manner.

12:24.640 --> 12:26.040
I had a baby the next year.

12:26.120 --> 12:28.040
People of our generation, am I right?

12:28.120 --> 12:29.440
Especially your generation.

12:29.520 --> 12:31.560
Chasity was important.

12:31.640 --> 12:34.160
Who was like them,
not caring about anything?

12:34.240 --> 12:35.160
Me.

12:38.000 --> 12:39.040
Is this you?

12:39.120 --> 12:40.560
So if you are asking me about this,

12:40.640 --> 12:42.760
you're asking the wrong person.

12:42.840 --> 12:44.120
Some people think

12:44.200 --> 12:45.800
the love of a man and a woman

12:45.880 --> 12:47.840
can burn for only so many years.

12:47.920 --> 12:50.560
But I do not think so.

12:50.640 --> 12:52.040
One's life is one's own.

12:52.120 --> 12:53.320
Let them be.

12:53.400 --> 12:55.280
Otherwise, when you are old

12:55.360 --> 12:56.720
and look back,

12:57.520 --> 12:58.520
you will regret it.

13:03.400 --> 13:04.880
I have a good idea

13:04.960 --> 13:06.560
of how to promote the Vacuum Chicken.

13:06.640 --> 13:07.600
In two days,

13:07.680 --> 13:09.280
you can go to the pharmaceutical factory.

13:09.360 --> 13:10.200
I heard

13:10.280 --> 13:12.280
that their year-end employee gifts
are really good.

13:12.360 --> 13:14.560
Last year, everyone was given
a box of organic oil,

13:14.640 --> 13:15.840
a few bags of vacuum beef,

13:15.920 --> 13:16.880
and organic rice.

13:16.960 --> 13:18.720
You can try to sell your Vacuum Chicken.

13:18.800 --> 13:20.760
You helped the town sell yams.

13:20.840 --> 13:21.920
That was done beautifully.

13:22.000 --> 13:24.120
Everyone is genuinely grateful to you.

13:24.200 --> 13:25.960
No matter what,
they will return the favor.

13:28.760 --> 13:31.200
Why do you keep touching your lips?

13:31.280 --> 13:33.240
Is the weather so dry
that your lips are peeling?

13:34.640 --> 13:35.960
I'll send you a lip mask tomorrow.

13:36.760 --> 13:38.000
No need. I still have some.

13:39.040 --> 13:40.560
Then what's wrong with you?

13:40.640 --> 13:42.080
All right. I'm hanging up.

13:42.160 --> 13:43.560
I have a morning meeting tomorrow.

13:43.640 --> 13:44.680
Wang Xixia.

13:44.760 --> 13:47.280
Why are you hemming and hawing today?
Spit it out.

13:49.360 --> 13:51.240
Then what is our relationship right now?

13:57.520 --> 13:58.560
Say,

14:00.560 --> 14:02.720
deep down, am I a cowardly person?

14:03.560 --> 14:04.880
If we're talking about this,

14:04.960 --> 14:06.280
I'm suddenly not sleepy anymore.

14:06.760 --> 14:09.840
I smell some gossip ahead.

14:09.920 --> 14:11.040
Screw off.

14:15.000 --> 14:17.240
I'm just a little disappointed in myself.

14:17.320 --> 14:19.920
ALARM: CHEN MAIDONG REMINDS YOU
TO CHANGE THE MEDICINAL PATCH

14:23.200 --> 14:24.880
Hold on. Let me change my medicinal patch.

14:25.680 --> 14:26.920
Okay, change it.

14:33.040 --> 14:35.320
Ji Tong and I dragged things out
for over three years.

14:36.240 --> 14:38.440
I always thought he was the problem.

14:39.840 --> 14:41.600
But today I suddenly realized

14:42.600 --> 14:43.480
that maybe deep down,

14:43.560 --> 14:45.320
I lack the courage to catch feelings.

14:45.400 --> 14:46.680
I can't blame it on others.

14:46.760 --> 14:48.520
Zhuang Jie, let me remind you.

14:48.600 --> 14:49.720
If you dare

14:49.800 --> 14:51.200
to give Ji Tong another chance--

14:52.440 --> 14:53.640
What are you saying?

14:54.200 --> 14:55.520
I'm reflecting on myself.

14:55.600 --> 14:56.880
Seeing my true nature.

14:56.960 --> 14:59.200
What's the use of self-reflection?

14:59.280 --> 15:01.720
You have to take a practical step forward

15:01.800 --> 15:03.360
or you'll be forever running in circles.

15:03.920 --> 15:04.920
That makes sense.

15:07.400 --> 15:09.880
CUI GE'S SECRET ANCESTRAL RECIPE
HUANGPU DISTRICT, SHANGHAI

15:11.560 --> 15:12.440
Wang Xixia.

15:13.640 --> 15:15.920
In fact, the two of us are similar.

15:16.520 --> 15:17.920
We're both messed up deep down.

15:18.000 --> 15:19.080
We have to grow together.

15:19.160 --> 15:20.960
Worry about yourself first.

15:21.040 --> 15:22.280
Is there no more gossip?

15:22.360 --> 15:23.200
I'm going to sleep.

15:23.280 --> 15:24.560
Wait a minute.

15:24.640 --> 15:26.520
Before you go to bed,
I want to ask for a favor.

15:26.600 --> 15:27.520
Say it.

15:29.040 --> 15:30.640
I recently discovered a medicinal patch.

15:31.320 --> 15:33.440
It works wonders for my nerve pain.

15:33.520 --> 15:35.240
But it's limited in stock.

15:35.720 --> 15:37.000
I looked it up.

15:37.560 --> 15:39.720
The maker's Chinese medicine clinic
is in Shanghai.

15:39.800 --> 15:41.120
Send me the address. I'll buy it.

15:41.200 --> 15:42.440
Don't agree too quickly.

15:42.520 --> 15:43.800
What if you fail to buy it?

15:43.880 --> 15:45.560
Stop talking nonsense.

15:45.640 --> 15:46.680
As long as you need it,

15:46.760 --> 15:48.960
I will go through hell and high water
to get it for you.

15:49.040 --> 15:51.400
But let me get some sleep first, okay?

15:53.840 --> 15:54.800
Bye.

16:04.640 --> 16:05.600
FOUNDER: CUI GE

16:05.680 --> 16:06.720
Cui Ge,

16:06.800 --> 16:08.160
that's all the help I can give you.

16:28.840 --> 16:33.080
INSTRUCTIONS FOR MEDICINAL PATCH

16:48.560 --> 16:50.960
LIAOGEN CHICKEN

16:55.200 --> 16:56.840
What are you doing?

16:57.520 --> 16:58.560
Did you see a ghost?

16:59.280 --> 17:00.320
I got the wrong person.

17:02.360 --> 17:03.360
What's wrong?

17:03.440 --> 17:05.160
Is your boss still stalking you?

17:05.240 --> 17:07.119
Your company doesn't seem very busy.

17:07.200 --> 17:09.280
He can afford
to leisurely hang out in our town.

17:10.200 --> 17:11.359
He's leaving today.

17:11.440 --> 17:12.720
Stop complaining.

17:13.720 --> 17:15.800
Why do you have to send him off?

17:16.440 --> 17:18.720
I should go out of courtesy.

17:18.800 --> 17:20.160
I don't understand.

17:20.640 --> 17:22.280
He goes his way. You live your life.

17:22.359 --> 17:24.280
Do you have
to be so sneaky and absent-minded?

17:24.359 --> 17:25.599
I'm telling you, Zhuang Jie.

17:25.680 --> 17:26.520
I can't stand a woman

17:26.599 --> 17:28.079
who loses her composure over a man.

17:30.080 --> 17:31.960
Hello. What would you like?

17:32.680 --> 17:35.000
I want four chicken wings
and one whole braised chicken.

17:35.080 --> 17:36.120
Okay.

17:37.320 --> 17:39.160
You haven't had time
for breakfast, have you?

17:39.240 --> 17:41.160
Working at the funeral parlor
must be tough.

17:41.240 --> 17:42.400
You have to head out so early.

17:42.480 --> 17:43.920
Four chicken wings.

17:44.000 --> 17:45.480
One whole braised chicken.

17:45.560 --> 17:46.760
I'll place them together.

17:46.840 --> 17:47.680
Okay.

17:47.760 --> 17:48.600
Scan here, right?

17:48.680 --> 17:49.520
Yes.

17:52.520 --> 17:53.720
Okay, here you go.

17:53.800 --> 17:55.320
Thanks. Goodbye.

17:55.400 --> 17:56.480
Okay. Thank you.

18:04.320 --> 18:08.720
LIAOGEN BRAISED CHICKEN

18:22.400 --> 18:23.760
Master, is it all yours?

18:23.840 --> 18:24.880
You had breakfast though.

18:39.200 --> 18:41.080
Hai, if I may be frank…

18:41.160 --> 18:42.160
I know.

18:42.240 --> 18:43.800
If we don't leave, we'll be late.

18:44.480 --> 18:46.160
But I'm not the one driving today.

18:46.240 --> 18:47.240
Why are you telling me?

19:13.680 --> 19:14.880
Ji Tong,

19:14.960 --> 19:15.800
have a safe journey.

19:17.400 --> 19:18.800
I waited for you for several days.

19:19.560 --> 19:21.320
But I didn't get to see you again.

19:24.360 --> 19:25.960
We are both prideful people.

19:26.960 --> 19:27.800
I understand you.

19:27.880 --> 19:30.240
You are stubborn for your own sake.

19:30.320 --> 19:31.960
I rejected you for my own sake too.

19:32.040 --> 19:33.960
So let's end it here.

19:34.440 --> 19:35.520
That's the best for us.

19:36.920 --> 19:37.800
Sure.

19:39.360 --> 19:40.200
I understand.

19:52.120 --> 19:52.960
NANPING NORTH STATION

19:53.040 --> 19:55.600
Master, Hai has already
picked up the body.

19:55.680 --> 19:57.560
Leave the rest of the process to me.

19:57.640 --> 19:58.640
You can go home and rest.

19:58.720 --> 20:00.000
You have the night shift tonight.

20:01.080 --> 20:02.440
Deaths from unexpected illnesses

20:02.520 --> 20:04.040
will have many cumbersome procedures.

20:10.240 --> 20:12.160
Well, that's it. I'm leaving first.

20:18.760 --> 20:19.600
We're in Nanping.

20:19.680 --> 20:20.920
We don't do French farewells.

20:22.320 --> 20:23.200
Zhuang Jie,

20:24.160 --> 20:25.520
you've changed a lot.

20:26.520 --> 20:28.960
Maybe you had the wrong idea
about me in the past.

20:29.040 --> 20:30.080
That's not important.

20:30.160 --> 20:32.000
You could at least see me
to my seat, right?

20:47.240 --> 20:48.600
If you are sending off passengers,

20:48.680 --> 20:49.720
alight the train quickly.

20:49.800 --> 20:51.120
The train is departing soon.

20:57.840 --> 20:59.120
Master.

20:59.200 --> 21:00.840
Master!

21:06.640 --> 21:07.920
Goodbye.

21:08.000 --> 21:08.960
Jamie.

21:09.040 --> 21:09.880
Jamie.

21:10.840 --> 21:12.640
Is there really no hope for us?

21:14.680 --> 21:15.600
Ji Tong, let go of me.

21:16.560 --> 21:17.400
Let go of me.

21:23.320 --> 21:24.200
Chen Maidong!

21:25.280 --> 21:26.440
Who do you think you are?

21:30.120 --> 21:31.680
Did no one in Shanghai teach you

21:32.160 --> 21:33.760
not to force a woman?

21:50.120 --> 21:51.400
Chen Maidong.

21:56.240 --> 21:57.560
You like this, don't you?

22:01.320 --> 22:02.440
Like what?

22:04.240 --> 22:06.600
You enjoy being entangled
with a man in public,

22:07.240 --> 22:09.240
waiting for others
to take photos of you, right?

22:09.320 --> 22:10.920
Chen Maidong, are you being stupid again?

22:11.000 --> 22:12.040
Not as stupid as you.

23:55.800 --> 23:57.400
Did no one in Nanping teach you

23:58.240 --> 23:59.960
not to force a woman?

24:00.720 --> 24:01.960
What about gender equality?

24:03.160 --> 24:04.280
If you can kiss me,

24:04.880 --> 24:05.920
why can't I kiss you?

24:08.840 --> 24:10.040
Rogue.

24:41.680 --> 24:42.600
Where to?

24:44.400 --> 24:46.400
I want to go to the pharmaceutical factory

24:46.480 --> 24:47.320
to try my luck.

24:48.840 --> 24:49.920
For a business deal?

24:51.160 --> 24:52.600
I want to promote our Vacuum Chicken

24:52.680 --> 24:55.040
and try to make it
part of the factory's year-end gifts.

24:56.720 --> 24:57.960
Did you make an appointment?

24:58.640 --> 25:01.000
No, that's why I said I'm trying my luck.

25:04.360 --> 25:05.280
Okay.

25:06.080 --> 25:07.160
I'll send you there first.

25:08.120 --> 25:09.840
Aren't you going back to work?

25:12.040 --> 25:13.640
It's okay. It's the lunch break now.

25:17.520 --> 25:18.440
Taxi.

25:49.200 --> 25:50.600
Hello, Ms. Wang Xixia.

25:50.680 --> 25:51.960
It's your turn. Please follow me.

25:52.600 --> 25:53.520
Okay, let's go.

25:53.600 --> 25:54.480
Let's go.

25:55.760 --> 25:56.600
This way, please.

25:59.880 --> 26:01.440
-Thanks.
-You're welcome.

26:02.440 --> 26:03.520
Hello.

26:06.200 --> 26:07.920
I recently discovered a medicinal patch.

26:08.000 --> 26:09.760
It works wonders for my nerve pain.

26:09.840 --> 26:11.320
But it's limited in stock.

26:11.400 --> 26:12.760
I looked it up.

26:12.840 --> 26:14.440
The maker's Chinese medicine clinic

26:14.520 --> 26:15.520
is in Shanghai.

26:18.800 --> 26:20.680
I thought it was someone else
with the same name.

26:20.760 --> 26:22.240
I didn't expect it to really be you.

26:22.760 --> 26:24.240
Have a seat. Give me your arm.

26:26.160 --> 26:28.760
You don't need to be so embarrassed
about your illness, do you?

26:28.840 --> 26:30.240
If you're sick, you should treat it.

26:30.320 --> 26:32.920
I'm unlucky, not embarrassed.

26:34.560 --> 26:36.760
It seems you really hate me a lot.

26:37.840 --> 26:40.080
Did you think
I was just pretending before this?

26:40.160 --> 26:41.320
Indeed, I just noticed.

26:43.840 --> 26:44.800
I really don't know

26:45.800 --> 26:48.760
how I managed to offend you before.

26:48.840 --> 26:49.800
I'm sorry.

26:50.520 --> 26:52.200
Well, once you leave my clinic,

26:52.280 --> 26:53.360
go 700 m south.

26:53.440 --> 26:54.440
There's another clinic.

26:54.520 --> 26:55.560
They're not bad.

26:56.200 --> 26:57.480
Why don't you get checked there?

27:00.200 --> 27:01.040
I'm not sick.

27:01.720 --> 27:03.560
My friend asked me
to buy some patches here.

27:03.640 --> 27:04.800
She told me it's made here.

27:04.880 --> 27:06.360
It's not sold anywhere else.

27:07.440 --> 27:08.720
The friend with a leg problem?

27:09.880 --> 27:11.760
How did you know
she has problems with her leg?

27:13.040 --> 27:14.880
Because I'm really a doctor.

27:15.360 --> 27:16.600
I didn't say you weren't.

27:16.680 --> 27:18.560
I'm asking how you can tell.

27:19.280 --> 27:20.640
When you two were talking loudly

27:20.720 --> 27:21.880
about buying underwear…

27:22.680 --> 27:24.080
Don't mention the underwear.

27:27.360 --> 27:28.280
Okay.

27:37.400 --> 27:39.040
Do you sell the medicinal patches?

27:39.600 --> 27:40.560
You have to order them.

27:40.640 --> 27:41.680
I want to order 50, then.

27:42.400 --> 27:44.000
There is no need to stock up on this.

27:44.080 --> 27:45.920
First, you have to see if it works.

27:46.560 --> 27:47.520
Twenty should suffice.

27:48.400 --> 27:49.360
I'll pay you, then.

27:50.120 --> 27:51.000
Pay on delivery.

27:52.120 --> 27:53.760
Please leave your phone number
and address.

27:57.280 --> 27:59.000
If you don't want to come by again,

27:59.080 --> 28:00.360
I'll have it delivered to you.

28:02.160 --> 28:03.680
I'll give it to the front desk.

28:07.680 --> 28:08.520
Thanks.

28:12.240 --> 28:13.160
You're welcome.

28:17.520 --> 28:19.360
Zhuang Jie, did you prank me on purpose?

28:19.440 --> 28:20.800
Do you think you're safe from me

28:20.880 --> 28:21.880
because you're far away?

28:23.120 --> 28:24.280
Did you go to buy the patches?

28:24.360 --> 28:25.480
You're so efficient.

28:25.560 --> 28:27.440
As expected from my true bestie.

28:28.040 --> 28:29.000
Don't blame me for this.

28:29.080 --> 28:30.760
I really need this patch.

28:30.840 --> 28:32.080
Also, I did warn you.

28:32.160 --> 28:33.720
I told you not to agree so quickly.

28:39.560 --> 28:42.880
But this is the last time
I'll do something like this.

28:42.960 --> 28:45.000
If you and Cui Ge really are incompatible,

28:45.080 --> 28:46.040
don't force it.

28:46.640 --> 28:48.400
Today, I went
to the pharmaceutical factory.

28:48.480 --> 28:49.640
It didn't work out.

28:49.720 --> 28:51.320
I didn't see the person in charge.

28:51.400 --> 28:52.920
They told me that this year's gifts

28:53.000 --> 28:53.840
were all distributed.

28:58.000 --> 28:59.000
Were you waiting for me?

29:02.440 --> 29:03.280
Of course.

29:09.680 --> 29:11.360
You didn't tell me in advance.

29:11.440 --> 29:13.440
What if I was in there
for a very long time?

29:14.120 --> 29:15.440
I expected you to be out of luck.

29:15.960 --> 29:17.640
It's not easy to hail a taxi here.

29:17.720 --> 29:18.960
Can you predict the future?

29:19.040 --> 29:20.640
Why did you think I would be out of luck?

29:23.880 --> 29:24.720
Let's go.

29:24.800 --> 29:25.760
Let's eat first.

29:26.880 --> 29:28.160
Depending on my mood,

29:28.240 --> 29:29.960
I will decide
if I'll give you some pointers.

30:14.440 --> 30:15.280
Here.

30:21.080 --> 30:22.520
Take it easy.

30:24.760 --> 30:25.600
Tao,

30:25.680 --> 30:27.240
I understand now.

30:27.760 --> 30:29.880
All children are debt collectors.

30:32.160 --> 30:33.520
I told you already.

30:33.600 --> 30:34.800
Children have their own lives.

30:34.880 --> 30:35.960
Don't meddle.

30:36.040 --> 30:37.680
It will only trouble you.

30:37.760 --> 30:38.600
Why bother?

30:39.400 --> 30:40.280
Okay.

30:40.360 --> 30:41.360
We're at this age already.

30:41.440 --> 30:42.920
It's better to take care of yourself.

30:43.000 --> 30:43.960
Here.

30:49.080 --> 30:50.200
Let me tell you.

30:50.280 --> 30:51.960
You say this
because you're not in my shoes.

30:52.040 --> 30:53.960
Zhuang Jie takes care of herself well.

30:54.040 --> 30:56.200
You don't understand how I feel at all.

30:56.280 --> 30:57.440
Come on.

30:57.520 --> 30:58.720
Takes care of herself?

30:59.640 --> 31:01.880
I lost sleep
worrying about finding her a partner

31:01.960 --> 31:03.160
a few years ago.

31:03.240 --> 31:05.440
In the blink of an eye, she is almost 30.

31:05.520 --> 31:06.680
I have moved on.

31:06.760 --> 31:08.160
She can do what she wants.

31:08.240 --> 31:09.880
At worst, when she's old and I'm dead,

31:09.960 --> 31:10.920
she and Wang Xixia

31:11.000 --> 31:12.360
can enter a nursing home together.

31:12.440 --> 31:13.280
That would be nice.

31:14.000 --> 31:15.160
That's true.

31:15.240 --> 31:16.280
Zhuang Jie

31:16.760 --> 31:17.680
is capable.

31:17.760 --> 31:19.600
She knows what she is doing.

31:19.680 --> 31:20.960
Not like my daughter.

31:21.040 --> 31:23.160
She's always doing her own thing in town.

31:23.240 --> 31:24.600
What a disgrace!

31:25.600 --> 31:28.200
You've spoiled them since they were kids.

31:28.280 --> 31:29.600
It's too late to worry about it.

31:30.560 --> 31:32.720
If Zhuang Jie dared to act crudely,

31:32.800 --> 31:34.560
getting tangled with some guy,

31:34.640 --> 31:36.000
kissing and touching in town.

31:36.080 --> 31:37.800
I won't even have to tell her fortune.

31:37.880 --> 31:39.040
I'll take her life myself!

31:48.840 --> 31:49.960
Chen Maidong.

31:50.920 --> 31:53.080
This dish looks good.

31:53.160 --> 31:54.400
That's because I made it.

31:55.240 --> 31:56.240
Not my grandma.

31:57.880 --> 32:00.280
How did you know I had no chance
at the pharmaceutical factory?

32:00.360 --> 32:01.920
Do you have to go straight to the point?

32:02.000 --> 32:03.720
It's not the first day you've known me.

32:05.960 --> 32:07.720
They're the leading enterprise in town.

32:07.800 --> 32:10.000
They have a lot to consider
when it comes to gifts.

32:10.680 --> 32:11.560
They will either first

32:11.640 --> 32:13.160
support new industries in town

32:13.240 --> 32:15.760
or the college students
who are returnee entrepreneurs.

32:15.840 --> 32:17.840
A private self-employed body like you
has no chance.

32:23.160 --> 32:24.440
I'm a returnee entrepreneur too.

32:25.200 --> 32:26.400
Do you count as one?

32:27.200 --> 32:29.920
Why not? I'm an old college student
who found her way back.

32:30.000 --> 32:30.960
Is that not allowed?

32:31.440 --> 32:32.280
Sure, it is.

32:32.360 --> 32:34.360
But these college students
have to settle in town.

32:34.440 --> 32:35.520
Can you do that?

32:37.640 --> 32:38.920
Then I really can't do it.

32:41.320 --> 32:42.200
Eat first.

32:55.000 --> 32:56.000
Do the patches work?

32:56.080 --> 32:57.280
Of course.

32:57.360 --> 32:59.880
It has been getting colder,
but I'm still bouncing about.

33:00.800 --> 33:01.960
That's good.

33:02.040 --> 33:03.000
I'll get more later.

33:03.080 --> 33:04.440
It's all right. I found the source.

33:04.520 --> 33:05.720
I asked Wang Xixia to buy it.

33:07.600 --> 33:08.920
Throwing me away after using me?

33:09.000 --> 33:10.120
You're something.

33:11.680 --> 33:13.000
What do you know?

33:13.080 --> 33:14.960
I just might help a love to blossom.

33:15.520 --> 33:17.800
You haven't even figured out
your own affairs yet.

33:19.440 --> 33:20.360
Who says?

33:20.440 --> 33:22.120
I have never been one to drag things out.

33:23.400 --> 33:24.680
Come on.

33:24.760 --> 33:26.440
If I hadn't saved you from Ji Tong,

33:26.520 --> 33:28.000
he would've dragged you to Shanghai.

33:28.080 --> 33:29.120
Nonsense.

33:29.200 --> 33:31.440
I made it clear to him
at the barbecue restaurant that day.

33:43.400 --> 33:44.560
I'm almost 30.

33:45.480 --> 33:48.080
I'm not some young girl
obsessed with love.

33:49.120 --> 33:51.160
I know how to protect myself
better than anyone.

33:51.240 --> 33:53.720
My views on marriage and love
are very realistic.

33:53.800 --> 33:55.680
There are men who mind my disability

33:55.760 --> 33:56.920
from the core of their being.

33:57.000 --> 33:58.680
I can understand, but I won't like them.

33:59.480 --> 34:02.000
Because they are the ones
who let this disability be a problem.

34:02.560 --> 34:03.400
Not me.

34:05.800 --> 34:07.200
You have a clear head.

34:12.159 --> 34:14.239
I have a clear head
because I'm calculative.

34:14.719 --> 34:16.960
One is calculative
when there is a lack of love.

34:17.560 --> 34:18.840
It's the same for both parties.

34:20.199 --> 34:22.560
For grown-ups to approach love
like a moth attracted to fire

34:23.239 --> 34:24.159
isn't easy.

34:24.719 --> 34:25.719
That's why

34:26.600 --> 34:29.280
everyone has to face reality.

34:29.960 --> 34:31.760
People can't survive

34:31.840 --> 34:33.480
on romantic gestures

34:34.320 --> 34:35.480
and emotional impulses.

34:40.080 --> 34:41.520
Are you trying to brainwash me again?

34:42.400 --> 34:44.080
Are you going to say
since we're grown-ups,

34:44.159 --> 34:45.880
we shouldn't take things too seriously?

34:48.440 --> 34:49.360
Chen Maidong,

34:50.719 --> 34:51.560
I like you.

34:52.840 --> 34:53.679
I'm serious.

34:56.199 --> 34:57.680
But I love Shanghai more.

34:58.880 --> 35:00.800
This is the reality between you and me.

35:30.800 --> 35:31.680
Chen Maidong,

35:32.320 --> 35:34.160
the most admirable thing about you

35:35.920 --> 35:37.840
is that you are willing
to listen to women.

35:38.320 --> 35:39.440
And you understand it too.

35:40.520 --> 35:41.840
Unlike some men

35:41.920 --> 35:43.440
who are just as disabled as I am.

35:44.480 --> 35:45.840
They have ears

35:45.920 --> 35:46.760
but never listen

35:46.840 --> 35:48.000
to what the woman is saying.

35:50.000 --> 35:51.040
Stop flattering me.

35:53.640 --> 35:54.680
Okay.

35:54.760 --> 35:55.840
Let's get to the point.

35:57.840 --> 35:59.400
Maidong, please give me some pointers.

35:59.480 --> 36:01.560
What other policies
does the town have for returnees

36:01.640 --> 36:02.800
to promote the Vacuum Chicken?

36:03.560 --> 36:05.760
Don't always think of
taking advantage of the town.

36:05.840 --> 36:07.920
Leave the good policies
to those who need them more.

36:08.480 --> 36:10.240
We don't have it easy either.

36:11.520 --> 36:12.600
Then use your brain.

36:13.400 --> 36:15.600
Don't always look
at the pharmaceutical factories.

36:16.280 --> 36:17.280
The town's stone quarry

36:17.360 --> 36:18.600
has nearly 1,000 employees.

36:18.680 --> 36:19.840
They also need to give gifts.

36:20.600 --> 36:22.680
I'm even less familiar
with the stone quarry.

36:24.040 --> 36:25.040
I'm familiar with them.

36:25.960 --> 36:27.000
Wait for the news.

36:32.680 --> 36:34.200
Thank you, Maidong.

36:36.360 --> 36:37.600
Look at your snobbery.

36:40.000 --> 36:41.000
Give it back.

36:41.080 --> 36:42.040
I'm not full yet.

37:11.040 --> 37:12.040
What's going on here?

37:14.080 --> 37:15.120
Madam Wu just left.

37:15.680 --> 37:16.880
She was crying.

37:16.960 --> 37:18.400
She was all tears and snot.

37:18.480 --> 37:20.560
It shrouded our mom
in a frog of melancholy.

37:21.120 --> 37:22.400
"Fog" of melancholy.

37:22.480 --> 37:23.560
It doesn't matter.

37:24.320 --> 37:25.520
Madam Wu's menopause

37:25.600 --> 37:27.000
is lasting longer than your puberty.

37:28.120 --> 37:30.640
Stop making fun of us middle-aged women.

37:30.720 --> 37:32.600
Sooner or later,
you two will face the same fate.

37:32.680 --> 37:33.680
Sorry.

37:34.280 --> 37:35.400
I had a bad attitude.

37:36.120 --> 37:37.480
I will go downstairs and reflect.

37:43.320 --> 37:44.680
Help Madam Wu

37:44.760 --> 37:47.040
give it to Ms. Lin
at the veterinary clinic in town.

37:47.640 --> 37:49.240
Why is Madam Wu giving Ms. Lin money?

37:50.200 --> 37:51.320
Is her old dog sick?

37:52.240 --> 37:53.680
Why are you cursing her dog?

37:53.760 --> 37:56.080
Madam Wu asked Ms. Lin for advice

37:56.160 --> 37:57.280
for her worrisome daughter.

37:57.360 --> 37:59.160
Although it didn't help much,

37:59.240 --> 38:00.720
Madam Wu is a very particular person.

38:00.800 --> 38:02.200
She wants to express her gratitude.

38:02.280 --> 38:04.120
Sure, I'll deliver it when I'm free.

38:06.320 --> 38:07.560
Mom,

38:07.640 --> 38:09.000
don't be like Madam Wu.

38:09.080 --> 38:10.360
Don't seek advice for me.

38:11.000 --> 38:12.160
You wish.

38:12.240 --> 38:13.960
I won't ask for anyone's help.

38:14.520 --> 38:16.480
I can take care of the children
I birthed myself.

38:16.560 --> 38:17.920
I don't need help.

38:37.400 --> 38:38.440
Thank you, Mr. Shao.

38:38.520 --> 38:39.920
I will not let you down.

38:40.000 --> 38:41.400
The stone quarry's annual gifts

38:41.480 --> 38:43.040
will be presentable and beautiful.

38:43.120 --> 38:44.040
You're welcome.

38:44.120 --> 38:45.120
Let's help each other.

38:45.680 --> 38:47.760
You previously helped Yanggou Village
sell their yams.

38:47.840 --> 38:49.640
Everyone in the town remembers it.

38:49.720 --> 38:51.520
It was a small matter.

38:51.600 --> 38:53.360
But the stone quarry
selecting Liaogen Chicken

38:53.440 --> 38:55.400
is a really timely help for my family.

38:55.480 --> 38:57.440
Don't say that.

38:57.520 --> 38:59.000
I did not make this decision myself.

38:59.080 --> 39:01.560
Maidong played a greater role.

39:01.640 --> 39:02.520
Wait a moment.

39:03.040 --> 39:04.560
I thought Chen Maidong

39:04.640 --> 39:06.320
only sent my WeChat information to you.

39:06.400 --> 39:08.640
Of course not.
He is such a thoughtful person.

39:08.720 --> 39:11.440
Not only did he tell our director
about your family's situation,

39:11.520 --> 39:13.160
he even guaranteed the product himself.

39:13.240 --> 39:14.960
When the director's father passed away,

39:15.040 --> 39:16.040
Maidong helped him out.

39:16.120 --> 39:18.120
He has been waiting to return this favor.

39:18.200 --> 39:20.760
Maidong hasn't requested anything
all these years.

39:20.840 --> 39:21.960
So our factory director

39:22.040 --> 39:23.240
was certainly eager to help.

39:24.440 --> 39:26.120
Okay. Thank you, Mr. Shao.

39:26.200 --> 39:27.040
I should go.

39:27.120 --> 39:28.120
Sure. Take care.

39:28.200 --> 39:29.120
Thank you.

39:38.480 --> 39:40.080
Chen Maidong.

39:41.120 --> 39:44.840
Chen Maidong.

39:44.920 --> 39:46.000
Why did you come?

39:46.080 --> 39:47.280
What happened?

39:47.360 --> 39:48.640
You did such a big thing.

39:48.720 --> 39:50.280
Why didn't you take any credit?

39:52.720 --> 39:53.800
I'm asking you a question.

39:54.760 --> 39:56.480
You really like me, don't you?

39:56.560 --> 39:57.480
Stop fooling around.

39:58.320 --> 39:59.440
Your grandma is not at home.

39:59.520 --> 40:00.400
I just saw her.

40:00.480 --> 40:02.160
Still, it's not a good time.

40:02.240 --> 40:03.400
Are you playing dumb?

40:07.360 --> 40:08.400
Why are you pretending?

40:10.800 --> 40:12.320
Don't regret it later.

40:22.640 --> 40:24.600
Who cares about you?

40:24.680 --> 40:26.760
I pity you.

40:26.840 --> 40:28.440
Look at your mouth.

40:28.520 --> 40:30.120
Your lips are cracked.

40:31.200 --> 40:33.240
I came here to thank you

40:33.320 --> 40:34.520
for the deal with the quarry.

40:35.240 --> 40:36.440
Don't worry.

40:36.520 --> 40:37.480
I will work hard.

40:37.560 --> 40:38.680
I won't embarrass you.

40:41.600 --> 40:43.080
Look at how scared you are.

40:44.520 --> 40:46.600
Gender equality.

40:46.680 --> 40:48.600
I won't use force on you either.

40:55.760 --> 40:56.600
Hello,

40:56.680 --> 40:57.960
I am Chen Maidong's mother.

41:00.640 --> 41:01.720
Hello, ma'am.

41:02.760 --> 41:03.680
I am Zhuang Jie,

41:03.760 --> 41:06.840
Chen Maidong's high school classmate.

43:21.840 --> 43:28.320
ALL ANIMALS IN THIS PROGRAM
WERE TREATED KINDLY
